{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>沙田有人猝死。昨晚（11日）11時許，一名45歲林姓女子在沙田正街11至17號偉華中心住所暈倒，母親見狀報案。</p><p>救護員接報到場，林女昏迷被送往威爾斯親王醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡。女事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>據了解，林女有身體病紀錄。</p><figure><img alt=\"女事主昏迷被送往威爾斯親王醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197393504561532928462759.jpeg/kFzDxrkRQLEV-wuRFZfYMPN33WtgZav_LlSmPBRUpjw\"/><figcaption>女事主昏迷被送往威爾斯親王醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T20:03:59.643594+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T19:42:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T22:38:53.344366+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T19:57:23.917840+00:00","content_hash":"0efa96ed720b65cad17a8a9db5333938d1b9c42295b67a1a3382adfa8873a313","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}